meta {
  name: impersonate
  seq: 9
}

docs {
  Run auth (adminToken, waiterToken) and users (adminUserId, ownerUserId, waiterUserId) first.

  Inactive user (400 USER_INACTIVE) is not in the collection: the seed has no inactive account.
  To try it: in Compass set isActive: false on the waiter, send "Impersonate waiter", then set it back to true.
}
